==Battleground==
*2 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
*8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>.
*15 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>, delay 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The objective is to stall Camelle and Capy at the same time. That's easy enough. The problem comes when the Gabriels arrive, as they can be expected to push back and let Camelle and Capy reach further, possibly the base, which they can both destroy with immense ease. You'll need to be prepared and kill the Gabriels as soon as they arrive, which can be done with the help of a high level Slow Cannon, an extra tank to hold the line better, or something that deals high damage against them from a good enough distance. Once you kill the first wave, use the money to try and kill Capy or save all for the next, as no more Gabriels will spawn if you endure 3 rushes.

